{"text": "PHILIP MORRIS USA INTER-OFFICE CORRESPONDENCE\n1120 PARK AVENUE, NEW YORK, NY 10017-5592\n\nto: Tom Worcester . DATE: May 19, 1992\n\nClaire Iwatsu b-?\n\nSUBJECT: PARLIAMENT LIGHTS 2 PACK W/LIGHTER BB SWEATSHIRT ELEMENTS.\nMEMO CHECKLIST (PPP@) November 16, 1992-January 1, 1993\n\nFROM:\n\n\u2018The following provides details for the Parliament Lights 2 Pack w/Lighter BB\n\u2018Sweatshirt to be fielded mid-November through the end of December. This pack promotion is\nfor Region I mewo markets.\n\n\\. EIELD DATES\n+ PPP 8 November 16, 1992 - January 1, 1993,\n\n2. \u201cTIVE/RATIONALE\n+ To extend Parliament's Brand image and increase Brand awareness in Region I.\n+ To move volume in pack outlets by stimulating purchase among current and competitive\nyoung adult smokers.\n3. GEOGRAPHIC SCOPE\n\n+ Region I, Sections 11, 12, 13, 14\n\n4. KEY DATES\n\n+ November 2 - delivery date to FSF depots \u2018and distributors to allow for display\nassembly.\n\nNA\n\n6. BRAND STYLE\n+ Parliament Lights Kings box only.\n\nS\u00e9T698S\u00a20z",
